<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee strengthens against dollar.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee strengthens against dollar.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee strengthened against the dollar and sterling on Monday, in line with international trends, foreign exchange dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee was fixed at a mean commercial rate of 21.803 to the dollar from 21.852 on Friday and at 34.6375 to the pound from 34.7175.</p>
</text>
